You give AWS your LOCK (public key)
AWS puts it on the door of your EC2

You keep your KEY (private key)
only your key opens that lock

YOUR MACHINE                    AWS EC2
────────────────                ────────────────
🔑 private key                  🔒 public key
   (keep this)                     (lock on door)
      │                               │
      │    SSH connection             │
      └───────────────────────────────┘
      "does your key match the lock?"
      YES → you are in ✅
      NO  → access denied ❌

